{"2204560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mineral Madness", "steam_appid": 2204560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/6cd7689a3f6104a4ff64e5b56de2fe9f.avif?t=1766565219\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2–8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart—but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=852 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2–8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart—but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=852 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory in a fast-paced multiplayer party brawler! Battle other moles in wild, random caves, build your loadout, and deposit your minerals to win.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Norwegian, Polish, Romanian, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/7e3de70a2808acbf98c74d9a28a07ec8dbc45e8b/header.jpg?t=1766565219", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766565219", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766565219", "website": "https://www.whackymole.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or 11<br></li><